#: src/Abilities/AbilitiesModule.php:39
msgid "Page cache, queue, warming, and health evidence from GT Performance."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:43
msgid "A UUID you generate for this request. Retrying with the same ID returns the first result; a new operation needs a new ID."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:57
msgid "Preview a purge"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:58
msgid "Which cached URLs an update to a post would purge under the current policy, and why: its permalink and related archives plus every page whose recorded dependencies include the post, its terms, or its listings. Set membership for a publication, withdrawal, or term change. Purges nothing."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:77
msgid "Get an operation result"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:78
msgid "The state and result of an operation or settings proposal: accepted, running, succeeded, partial, failed, cancelled, proposed, applied, rejected, or expired. For purges, each URL reports the origin result, the edge provider's response, and what a public request returned afterwards. Poll this; it changes nothing."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:93
msgid "Purge URLs"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:94
msgid "Purge up to 20 URLs from this site's page cache and the configured edge cache (Cloudflare or xCloud), then request each publicly to report what visitors receive. Returns an operation ID at once; poll get-operation. Full-site and zone purges are not available here."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:107
msgid "Preload URLs"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:108
msgid "Queue preloads for up to 20 URLs from this site so they are rebuilt in the page cache. Duplicate preloads already waiting are reused. Returns an operation ID; its result lists the job IDs."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:121
msgid "Regenerate unused CSS"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:122
msgid "Queue a fresh unused-CSS build for one cacheable URL. Requires unused CSS optimization to be on. Returns an operation ID."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:139
msgid "Retry a failed job"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:140
msgid "Retry one failed preload, warming, unused-CSS, or image job (see list-jobs). Other job types, including purges, cannot be retried by an agent. Returns an operation ID."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:156
msgid "Propose a settings change"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:157
msgid "Propose changes to cache warming, JavaScript defer/delay, critical images, unused-CSS rollout, or the CSS safelist, based on the settings_hash from get-settings. This only records a proposal with a diff; an administrator must review and apply it in wp-admin within 15 minutes. It never changes settings by itself."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/OperateAbilities.php:197
msgid "No such operation on this site."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/Permissions.php:43
msgid "GT Performance abilities require an administrator account on this site."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/Permissions.php:46
msgid "GT Performance agent access is off. An administrator can allow read-only access on the GT Performance AI tab."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/Permissions.php:58
